metal2vulkan runtime draw path. Applies to the pinned metal2vulkan revision after the
NativeMetal bridge patches 0001-0007; also applies to the unpatched pin. Used by the
fuximetal=native helper only (build-fuxi-nativemetal.py); the FuxiMetal fallback
translator checkout stays unpatched.

